      "explanation": "Large header size (UDP has a tiny 8-byte header). • 2023 Q15: Primary difference between UDP and TCP? → ✓ Answer: B) UDP is faster than TCP but less reliable. • 2023 Q16: The purpose of UDP is to provide: → ✓ Answer: D) quick data transmission with minimal overhead. • 2023 Q17: Which application is likely to use UDP? → ✓ Answer: C) Video streaming (Chapter 5, Page 114). • 2023 Q18: Does UDP provide error-checking and retransmission? → ✓ Answer: B) Yes, it provides error-checking (via Checksum) but not retransmission. • 2025 CS/IS Q46 & 2023 Q32: In ............, demultiplexing uses destination port number only (or destination IP + destination port). → ✓ Answer: (A) UDP. • 2025 Credit Q50: In ............, demultiplexing uses 4-tuple: source and destination IP addresses and port numbers. → ✓ Answer: (C) TCP. • 2025 Credit Q30: UDP can be used for all of the following, except ............ → ✓ Answer: (D) IMAP (uses TCP)."
